# `npm run build` writes into internal/dashboard/webassets/bundle/dist, not
# here, so the Go embed compiles in the bytes Vite just emitted with no copy
# step in between. Nothing should land in web/dist; this catches it if the
# outDir is ever changed without changing the embed.
